# Data is never committed. Rebuild it with `make data`.
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. A bare `data/` matches a directory of
# that name at any depth, which silently excluded the whole src/data package.
/data/
*.parquet
*.csv
*.zip
*.CHECKSUM

# Results and figures are committed. Every table in the README cites a run
# directory, and a citation you cannot open is not a citation. The blanket
# data rules above would otherwise swallow the csv and parquet files, so they
# are re-included here. Negation only works because no parent directory of
# these paths is itself excluded; do not add `reports/` above.
!reports/results/**/*.csv
!reports/results/**/*.parquet
reports/data_quality.md
mlruns/

# Secrets
.env
*.key

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.ruff_cache/
